[144.315458, "o", "UE, so \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;255;84;112ma Hebrew filename or an em-dash directory prints C-quoted and octal-escaped, and a literal match against the real name never fires. Use\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;255;84;112m`-z` when the c\u001b[24Gumer takes NUL, or `git -c core.quotePath=false` for a line-oriented read. The same escaping applies to `git status \u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;255;84;112m--porcelain`\u001b[19G(v1)\u001b[24Gand\u001b[28G`git\u001b[33Gdiff\u001b[38G--name-only`.\u001b[52G(tool_mastery)\\n\u001b[70GWhy:\u001b[75GMeasured\u001b[84G2026-09-09\u001b[95Gon\u001b[98Gplatform\u001b[107G#11581:\u001b[115Ga\u001b[117Glane\u001b[122Gclassified\u001b[133Gtwo\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;255;84;112mpaths\u001b[12Gas\u001b[15Guntracked\u001b[25Gwith\u001b[30G`git\u001b[35Gls-files`,\u001b[46Gmoved\u001b[52Gthem\u001b[57Gout\u001b[61Gof\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68Gworktree,\u001b[78Gran\u001b[82G`git\u001b[87Gadd\u001b[91G-A`,\u001b[96Gand\u001b[100Grecorded\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gmoves\u001b[119Gas\u001b[122Gdeletions.\u001b[133GFour\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;255;84;112mfiles\u001b[12Gwere\u001b[17Glost\u001b[22Gfrom\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gcommit\u001b[38Gand\u001b[42Grestored\u001b[51Gby\u001b[54Ghand.\u001b[60GBoth\u001b[65Gpaths\u001b[71Gcarried\u001b[79Gnon-ASCII\u001b[89Gcharacters,\u001b[101Gso\u001b[104"]
